{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09473","headline":"学仙二首 二 · 韦应物","name":"学仙二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石上凿井欲到水，惰心一起中路止。\n岂不见古来三人俱弟兄，结茅深山读仙经。\n上有青冥倚天之绝壁，下有飕飀万壑之松声。\n仙人变化爲白鹿，二弟翫之兄诵读。\n读多七过可乞言，爲子心精得神仙。\n可怜二弟仰天泣，一失毫厘千万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}